# Evidence: keep text, ignore large images (keep originals locally)
docs/evidence/screenshots/*.png
docs/evidence/screenshots/*.jpg
docs/evidence/screenshots/*.jpeg
docs/evidence/screenshots/*.mov
docs/evidence/screenshots/*.mp4
!docs/evidence/screenshots/.gitkeep

